WEBVTT

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.640
Things are moving so fast.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.310
The moments ticking by.

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:24.150
I'm running through this city.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.980
To me, a savanna.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.320
Like it's struggling...

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.320
... trying to break free...

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.660
... I wanna test all this power!

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.320
I know that "The Answer"...

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.660
... is out there someplace.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:40.000
The answer that everyone looks for...

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.500
... from the day they're born.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.170
When all looks lost...

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.670
... and there's no escape...

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:49.340
... I turn to my dreams!

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:53.180
I'm not afraid of getting hurt...

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:56.510
... but I'm not strong, either.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:01:00.020
It's just that I can't stand...

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:03.450
... just doing nothing anymore!

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:06.960
Here we go, go! I'll just run on...

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.630
... and let nobody stop me now!

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:13.800
I wanna find the me in the future...

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:18.960
... and give her a reason for life!

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.260
Saygram, a Monster...

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.930
... and Halcyform, who made
the Pledge of lmmortality with him!

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.930
You're going to suck out
our life energy?!

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:41.930
Why?! For what reason?!

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:45.940
The only way to kill Halcyform
is to smash the Pledge Stone!

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:48.100
The only way! The only way!

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:03.690
"Staying Behind
for the Sake of Love"

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:16.730
Found it?

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:18.570
No. Something that looked like it.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:24.910
In the first place, we don't know what
this "Pledge Stone" looks like.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.580
Use your head!

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:29.750
A treasure can sometimes be hidden
practically out in the open!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:33.750
I still don't think
it'd be in the fireplace...

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:34.740
Shut up!

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.090
Miss Lina, that's mean!
How could you?!

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:43.590
It worked out. You can
check above the ceiling.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:46.600
Okay, you two guys!
Quit goofing off and work!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.100
You're impossible!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:48.930
Jeez!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:06.220
Miss Lina! Come here!

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.050
- What is it?
- What? What's up?

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:09.050
What?

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:11.890
Oh, my, my, my, my...

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:14.230
Well? It's really suspicious, isn't it?

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:16.890
So, you think the Pledge Stone
might be in here?

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.900
That may be true.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:21.900
Or they all might just be
regular stone statues.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.560
Right, Lina?

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:27.910
"Wind which blows across eternity..."

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:30.240
"Gather in my hand
and become my strength!"

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.730
Get Down!

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:35.410
Blam Gush!

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:39.570
Break!

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:51.600
Oh, I feel so much better now!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:55.600
I just had to get rid of those
creepy things all at once!

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:56.770
Be more careful!

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:00.540
What if this had been a trap
instead of the Pledge Stone?!

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.540
Well...

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.540
When that happens, it'll happen.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.870
Right. I knew it.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:10.550
Oh, my...

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:13.050
You guessed this one right,
Mr. Zelgadis.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.550
In this situation, I positively
don't need the compliment.

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:20.060
Well, then where's the real
Pledge Stone, then?

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:23.890
Oh, well. I can always just blast
the mansion with a Dragon Slave.

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.380
You're wasting your time.

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.910
You can search this
mansion all you want...

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:39.910
...and never find
the Pledge Stone.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.080
He's coming for us!

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.410
Amelia, into action!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.920
Now for the mightiest
of my mighty spells!

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:47.410
Ra... Tilt!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.260
It didn't work!

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.700
Amelia! Get back!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.360
Shadow Wave!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.210
She's been hit!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:09.540
Lighting!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.210
Behfis Bring!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:34.060
Such power... I want it.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.570
A little longer...

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.060
Just be patient a little longer...

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.240
Rubia.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.920
As long as we can't smash the Pledge Stone,
the Ra Tilt won't work.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:57.920
His spirit must be shielded
on the Astral Plane.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.360
And that was my killer spell, too...

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.360
Do something to
buy us some time!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.700
Is finding that stone
our only chance?!

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:06.200
Yeah.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:10.030
Which is why I said I hate
dealing with Monsters!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.690
Huh? What's up?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.720
Slugs! Slugs!

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:41.570
Get it off! Agh!

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.570
Miss Lina's totally panicking!

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.070
I've never seen her do that.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.240
Agh! Get off!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.240
I can't do it! I can't!
I can't! I can't!

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:52.240
I can't deal with slugs!
I can't! I can't!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:54.410
Give me some salt, Please!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.750
Oh, you...

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.410
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.520
What's going on?! Why did
you leave me all alone?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.520
Now that I think about it,
when did Mr. Zelgadis disappear?

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:10.690
Miss Lina? Mr. Gourry?
Mr. Zelgadis?

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.700
Daddy! Mommy! Sis!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.530
I hate slugs! I hate slugs!
I hate slugs...

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.050
Lina, let go!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.380
Are the slugs all gone?

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:36.050
Yeah, but we've got something
worse to deal with instead.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:45.400
Hmpf! If you want us to eat with you,
it's gonna cost a lot!

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.060
I don't think that's
what he has in mind.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:55.740
Hear me out and you need not
fear sitting at this table.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.410
Hear you out?

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:01.170
Won't you join me?

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.840
Fireball!

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.860
Yay! I got 'em all!

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.860
You did very well.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.530
Oh, Mr. Zelgadis!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:23.370
Don't slugs smell delicious
when you burn them to a crisp?

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.870
That's escargot.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:27.370
Well, come on. We can't
hang around here all day.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:29.530
We have to find the Pledge Stone
as soon as possible.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.200
Mr. Zelgadis?

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:40.210
Look out!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:44.550
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:55.570
What I want is to collect
people with power.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:58.900
Even if they aren't members
of the Monster race.

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.340
That's why Atlas City's Sorcerers' Guild...

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:04.840
...and Halcyform caught my attention.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:11.850
Since you've arrived,
it's prudent to invite you in as well.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:17.690
The name of Lina Inverse is
well known among the Monster race.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.020
Thanks for the compliment.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:22.530
If you so wish, you can make
the Pledge of Immortality...

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:25.530
...with me as Halcyform did.

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:26.360
Immortality?!

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:30.530
Yes, and you may finally
escape the death which...

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:35.530
...plagues foolish humans and avoid
their meaningless fate.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:43.040
Lina... Are you?

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:49.220
Join us and all your wishes
will be granted.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:52.560
I swear upon this mask.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:54.390
Is that all you wanted to say?

00:09:55.390 --> 00:10:00.560
You must take a lot of pleasure
pitying our "meaningless fates".

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:05.240
Unfortunately, I don't care
for games that have no goals.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:06.570
Lina!

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.240
Flow Break!

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:26.760
I'm just glad you didn't take that
Pledge of Immortality thing!

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:27.760
Of course I wouldn't!

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:28.930
Good ol' Lina!

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.760
Humor a person and you may get lucky!

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:33.250
Anyway, let's find that Pledge Stone!

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.100
What is this place?

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.600
It looks like some sort of laboratory.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:42.940
The Pledge Stone might be in here.

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:51.280
Tarimu and Demia...
What the heck is this?!

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.940
Lina! Come here!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.720
This is... Is that it?!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.890
Welcome.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.250
I never thought
you'd make it this far.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.920
It seems I underestimated you.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.270
I understand now.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.610
Why you want immortality so badly.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.450
Why you want life energy.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.210
And what it is you're
researching here.

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:14.900
Yes! It's all for Rubia here!

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:17.230
Rubia? That girl?

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:20.740
Yes. My greatest love.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:24.910
The one woman I truly love... Rubia.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:29.580
Rubia's smile made me
want nothing more.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:32.420
We lived every day
in perfect happiness.

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:33.250
But then...

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.890
I had...

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:28.740
I had lost my Rubia.
And I, too, was dying.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.230
But, just then...

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:32.900
Are you Death?

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:37.570
I am Saygram
of the Monster race.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.420
I will do anything
to bring Rubia back.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.090
I have taken
possession of eternity...

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.930
...to try and replay
that failed experiment.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:53.600
So why don't you ask that
Monster to bring Rubia back?

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.430
Don't ask for the impossible.

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:58.940
Saygram!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:05.360
Even one of the Monster race cannot
restore life where it has been lost.

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.880
All of this is for Rubia's sake.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.880
I'll transfer the life energy from them...

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:16.220
...into Rubia and bring her back to life!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.550
Amelia! Zelgadis!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:38.570
Soon now. Soon the time
for Rubia to awaken will come!

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.580
Awaken, Rubia.

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:18.220
First of all, we have to stop him.

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.050
Sorry about your girlfriend...

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.390
...but we're taking
Amelia and Zel back!

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:24.880
Diem Wing!

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.050
Zelas Goto!

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:36.900
Summoning a jellyfish...
Unusual spell.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.740
Just don't ask me to tell you
who taught it to me.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.400
Gourry! Now's your chance!
Get those two!

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.910
Gotcha!

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:46.240
And find the Pledge Stone
and smash it while you're at it!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:48.750
Huh?! That's too much!

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.080
I know it's too much.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:52.920
But you have to do it while
I buy us some time.

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.080
Freeze...

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.570
Vaal Flare!

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:12.360
I won't let you interfere!

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:18.200
He's... so powerful!

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:27.050
You fool. Why don't you finish them?

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:31.050
I don't recall promising
to follow your commands.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:34.550
Know your place, human!

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:44.560
A pledge is a pledge.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:50.570
You can search this
mansion all you want...

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:53.240
... and never find the Pledge Stone.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.080
I swear upon this mask!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.750
Gourry! Can you move?

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.020
Oh, I can't take much more of this.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:02.180
Just listen to me!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:04.850
Are you serious?

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:07.520
It's this or nothing!
Understand?

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:11.190
Now, awaken,
my beloved Rubia!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.870
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.200
Halcyform!

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.540
A final challenge!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.540
Fascinating.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.540
Flare Lance!

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.200
Balus Wall!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:30.880
Above me?!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:34.040
Clever! Trying to
hit me from behind-

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:37.050
Saygram, move!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:37.710
Gourry!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:02.500
I dunno what's happening,
but now's my chance!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:19.020
Rubia...

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.190
Just as I thought.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.200
Saygram's mask was
the Pledge Stone...

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.220
Rubia...

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.730
You've finally come back to me...

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:04.670
No. She's just being animated
by the life energy.

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:07.670
She's just a puppet now.

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:11.010
Rubia!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:14.020
Stop that.

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.180
You!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:20.520
For your sake, don't interfere,
Mr. Saygram.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:31.520
"Kill... me... please"

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:35.860
Rubia...

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:40.540
Forgive me, Rubia...

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:52.560
"Source of all power,
crimson fire burning bright!"

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.890
"Gather in my hand
and become an inferno..."

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:57.890
Guys, run for it!

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.890
Burst Flare!

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:10.740
That guy...

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:14.740
Was the Pledge of Immortality
really what he wanted?

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:17.080
Well, who can say now?

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.580
You let him burn himself up...

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.590
...before finding a way
to turn us back to normal!

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:26.260
You people are completely useless!

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.590
I'd watch what you say.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:31.760
Who do you think saved you, anyway?

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:34.100
Although we two got cocooned.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.600
Don't mention that!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:40.270
Um, I suppose our payment
is out of the question now.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:43.270
And we found no sign
of the Claire Bible here.

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:45.280
And we ran into a Monster, too.

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:47.780
So, where do we go now?

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:51.950
Well, let's start walking
and think of that later!

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.620
Come on, Zel, cheer up!

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:56.450
I just know we'll find
the Claire Bible for you!

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.950
Stop trying to comfort me.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.620
Hey! Don't just leave us!
Come back!

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:03.060
We aren't finished yet!
Demia, do something!

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:18.410
Something's taken control now.

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:23.580
Your life's hopes and dreams are gone.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:26.570
Are you satisfied with your life now?

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:33.260
Got that fin de siecle feeling...

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:37.090
... and spend every day preparing.

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:40.260
So let's get your engine running!

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:42.600
Throw off all of...

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:46.090
... that rusty common sense!

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:51.440
You want to be the talk of the world!

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:54.610
You want to have a shining future!

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:57.110
That and this are your true dreams.

00:21:57.110 --> 00:22:00.880
Don't let anyone get in your way!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:05.890
To be the talk of the world...

00:22:05.890 --> 00:22:09.560
... let the greatness inside burst out!

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:11.890
You only get one break in life...

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.560
... so let's say bye- bye...

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:14.900
... to your timid self!

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:17.560
It's all right!

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:24.070
Eh? I'm cursed?!

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:27.080
I wonder who is capable of
putting this curse on me?

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:31.580
Next Episode is: " You Can't Escape!
The Return of the Obsessive Martina!"

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:34.910
If you don't watch,
I'll go berserk!
